--- rect        -> [Numeric, Numeric]
--- rectangular -> [Numeric, Numeric]

実部と虚部を配列にして返します。

例:

  Complex(3).rect    # => [3, 0]
  Complex(3.5).rect  # => [3.5, 0]
  Complex(3, 2).rect # => [3, 2]

@see [[m:Numeric#rect]]

